<article class="env-lemma" id="04WU">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/04WU">Lemma <span data-tag="04WU">8.13.1</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a site. Let $U \in \mathop{\mathrm{Ob}}\nolimits (\mathcal{C})$. Then $j_ U : \mathcal{C}/U \to \mathcal{C}$ is a stack over $\mathcal{C}$ if and only if $h_ U$ is a sheaf. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
